/godotengine/godot/pull/110433.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-22T18:49:49Z"},"body":"Currently when adding a custom monitor to the debug panel with [`add_custom_monitor`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_performance.html#class-performance-method-add-custom-monitor), the monitor will always be `MONITOR_TYPE_QUANTITY` and display the monitor value as an integer. This PR allows users to pass in a `MonitorType` so that their custom debug monitors can be better formatted.\r\n\r\nI've also added `MONITOR_TYPE_PERCENTAGE` as another option.\r\n\r\n**EDIT 2025-9-15:** Here's a screenshot with some example custom monitors added\r\n<img width=\"880\" height=\"387\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/383e4da5-ad6a-4097-b7c3-11ec0370257e\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110433/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110433/timeline","per